// Stride Rush language template: every line the game speaks.
// Copy this file to <language>.lng and change only the text after each =. A * stands for a value,
// which $1, $2 and on place in your translation. Lines you leave out are spoken in English.

// Ammo packs
This weapon doesn't take any ammo.=This weapon doesn't take any ammo.
This weapon's reserve is already full.=This weapon's reserve is already full.
